  1	\section{Overloading Rules}\label{sec:rules}
  2	Now, we formalize the overloading rules informally discussed in Section~\ref{sec:motiv:fgf}
  3	for FGFV.
  4	
  5	\subsection{Formalization of Overloading Rules}\label{sec:rules:formal}
